// Syncthing ignore patterns for development workspaces
// Copy this file to your synced folder root and rename it to .stignore
//
// IMPORTANT: Without these patterns, paths containing spaces inside
// node_modules will trigger "invalid encrypted path" errors that crash
// ALL peer connections — not just the affected folder.
//
// These patterns apply to ALL subfolders recursively (**/ prefix).

// ── Node.js / JavaScript ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm
**/.yarn/cache
**/.yarn/unplugged
**/.npm

// ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/.svelte-kit
**/out

// ── Git internals ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.git

// ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.env

// ── IDE / Editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

// ── OS artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

// ── Logs and temp ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/.tmp
**/temp
